Package: heatham
Title: Highest Daily Temperature in Hamilton, ON (May - October, 2023 - 2026)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Damian", "Glauser", , "glauserd@mcmasetr.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: By using this function you can find what the highest temperature of each day in Hamilton, ON was. Output of the function is the highest measured temperature during that day in degrees Celsius. Data is available for May until October for the years from 2023 to 2026.
